indings","PigmentSDK","View subscription","Data shape","List subscription","Writes","Page selection","Implementation Patterns","Loading guard","Lifecycle","Render and performance","Cleanup (leak prevention)"],"name_hint":"building · pigment · frames","description_zh":"创建或编辑 Pigment Frame，即在沙箱 iframe 中通过 PigmentSDK 读取数据的自定义全页 JavaScript 可视化。"},{"path":"skills/designing-boards/SKILL.md","name":"designing-boards","description":"Always use when creating or editing a Board. This skill includes supporting files in this directory - explore as needed.","headings":["How to Use This Skill","Pigment Board Design Knowledge Base","When to Use This Skill","Supporting documents","Core Principles of Board Design in Pigment","Design Principles","Content Guidelines","Supported Widget Types","Text Widget Usage","View Widget Usage","KPI Widget Usage","Spacer Widget Usage","Prioritization Rules","Board Creation Workflow","Step 1: Define Board Purpose and Plan Board Pages","Step 2: Create Board Structure","Step 3: Find or create Views, then add widgets","Step 4: Update Board Pages"],"name_hint":"designing · boards","description_zh":"创建和编辑 Pigment Board，按需查阅同目录配套文件以完成看板设计。"},{"path":"skills/designing-views/SKILL.md","name":"designing-views","description":"Always use this skill when creating, editing, or needing to pick a View - including chart type and chart configuration, pivots (rows / columns / pages), breaking down \"by\" / \"per\" a dimension, filters, sorts, totals and aggregators, and display modes.","headings":["How to Use This Skill","UI and tool semantics (Views)","`values` (value fields)","`metricsLocation` (Metric & Table views)","`pivotFieldId`","`listPropertyPath` on pivots (grouping / hierarchy)","Discovering valid pivots","Other","CRITICAL RULES","Definitions","Views","Draft Views","Reuse vs create","View naming","Which supporting file to read"],"name_hint":"designing · views","description_zh":"创建、编辑或选择 Pigment View，配置图表类型、透视行列页、维度拆分、筛选、排序、总计、聚合器及显示模式。"},{"path":"skills/formatting-and-highlighting/SKILL.md","name":"formatting-and-highlighting","description":"Best practices for metric default formatting. Covers: decimals, prefix, suffix, currency ($/€), percent (%), K/M/bp/thousand/million scaling, thousand separator, sign / zero / negative handling, text mode (Text / Rich Text / URL / Image / LocaleDateTime), boolean display (checkbox / button). Load when creating or updating a metric's default format - and ALSO whenever you create a metric whose values are not plain counts, in particular a ratio, percentage, variance / growth, currency, boolean or text metric, EVEN IF the user said nothing about formatting: picking the default format is part of creating such a metric correctly. Use cases: format as, display as, show as percent, in millions, two decimals, no decimals, prefix with $, add currency, as K / M / bp, rich text, checkbox, ratio, url, multiplier.","headings":["How to Use This Skill","When to Use","CRITICAL RULES","Inference from metric name","Type-based defaults","Examples","Conditional formatting & highlighting"],"name_hint":"formatting · and · highlighting","description_zh":"设置 Pigment 指标的默认格式，包括小数、前后缀、币种、百分比、K/M/bp 缩放、千分位、正负和零值、文本类型及布尔显示。适用于新建或更新比率、增长、金额、布尔和文本指标，格式选择属于正确建模的一部分。"},{"path":"skills/integrating-pigment-data/SKILL.md","name":"integrating-pigment-data","description":"Use this skill when integrating external data into Pigment - importing an attached CSV file, deciding whether to import into dimensions vs transaction lists, mapping source columns to properties, configuring cross-application (P2P) imports, or troubleshooting data imports. For the step-by-step CSV file import, read data_import_csv.md. Do NOT use this skill for formula updates or list creation unrelated to a data import. This skill includes supporting files in this directory - explore as needed.","headings":["Integrating Pigment Data","When to Use This Skill","Import Workflow","Step 1: Identify Data Type","Step 2: Decide Import Target","Step 3: Map Columns & Import","Prerequisites","Task-Based Routing","Importing CSV Data","Understanding Integration Types","Documentation Files","Cross-References","Critical Notes"],"name_hint":"integrating · pigment · 数据","description_zh":"将外部数据集成至 Pigment，处理 CSV 导入、维度与交易清单目标选择、源列到属性映射、跨应用 P2P 导入及故障排查。CSV 步骤参见配套说明；不用于与导入无关的公式更新或清单创建。"},{"path":"skills/modeling-pigment-applications/SKILL.md","name":"modeling-pigment-applications","description":"Always use this skill when designing or modifying Pigment applications. Provides the mental model of a Pigment app (Application, Dimensions, Calendars, Metrics, Transaction Lists, Tables), the core concepts (dimension list vs property vs transaction list, metric vs table, sparsity, scope), the canonical order of architecture decisions, a minimal viable application pattern and pointers to deeper-dive docs (architecture, naming, hierarchies, calendars, principles, folders, subsets, performance).","headings":["Modeling Pigment Applications","When to Use This Skill","Mental Model","Core Concepts","Block types","Data visualization types","Engine vocabulary","Sibling decisions the agent gets wrong most often","Architecture: Decisions in Order","Minimal Viable Application","Critical Rules","Deeper Dives"],"name_hint":"modeling · pigment · applications","description_zh":"设计或修改 Pigment 应用架构，理解应用、维度、日历、指标、交易清单及表，区分属性与清单、指标与表，并考虑稀疏性和范围。提供架构决策顺序、最小可用模式及命名、层级、日历、性能等深入参考。"},{"path":"skills/optimizing-pigment-performance/SKILL.md","name":"optimizing-pigment-performance","description":"Always use this skill when troubleshooting slow calculations or timeouts, analyzing profiler output to identify bottlenecks, understanding scope propagation, managing sparsity, optimizing formula performance, improving iterative calculations, optimizing access rights performance, conducting systematic performance audits, auditing a Pigment application (modeling, formula hygiene, folders, boards, governance), cleaning unused dimensions, metrics, tables, properties, or boards, identifying dead or stale boards, or removing unused metrics. Modeler-agent skill for Performance Insights tools (performance_profile_change, get_top_blocks_by_performance), then classify and fix. Provides the optimization loop, audit vs cleaning modes, and routing to deep dives. Always profile before formula changes; never optimize from assumptions.","headings":["Optimizing Pigment Performance","When to Use This Skill","Performance Mental Model","Core Principles","Performance profiling tools (modeler agent)","Audit vs Cleaning (Application Hygiene)","Severity (canonical)","Deletion Order (canonical)","Scenario Cardinality","Bottleneck Routing","Quick Reference: Common Anti-Patterns","Cross-References","Critical Rules"],"name_hint":"optimizing · pigment · 性能/表现","description_zh":"诊断 Pigment 计算缓慢、超时及性能瓶颈，分析范围传播、稀疏性、公式、迭代计算和权限性能，也支持应用审计与无用资产清理。先用 Performance Insights 剖析，再分类处理；原说明要求修改公式前先测量，不能凭假设优化。"},{"path":"skills/planning-cycles-pigment-applications/SKILL.md","name":"planning-cycles-pigment-applications","description":"Always use this skill when the user mentions or implies versions, Actual, Actuals, Budget, Budgeting, Forecast, Reforecast, Rolling Forecast, Version, Versioning, Plan, switchover, scenarios, snapshots, planning cycles, Actual/Plan layering, plan vs actual, \"create version dimension\", \"set up versioning\", or asks for Actual Budget Forecast best practices — or when they extend realized data into a plan or budget (Actual/Budget/Plan layering, forward forecast from actuals) or need to combine or compare actual and plan versions and periods. Covers Version Dimensions (foundational to all planning applications), Native Scenarios (what-if), and Snapshots (freeze data).","headings":["Planning Cycles in Pigment","When to Use This Skill","Mental Model","Three Distinct Features","Decisions in Order","Versions vs Native Scenarios: Decision","Calendars vs Versions: Do Not Confuse Them","Glossary","Critical Rules","Deeper Dives"],"name_hint":"规划 · cycles · pigment · applications","description_zh":"设计 Pigment 计划周期及实际、预算、预测、滚动预测和版本分层，支持实际与计划跨版本或期间组合比较。覆盖版本维度、原生假设情景及冻结数据的快照。"},{"path":"skills/securing-pigment-applications/SKILL.md","name":"securing-pigment-applications","description":"Always use this skill when designing, applying, or debugging Access Rights and security in Pigment applications. Provides the AR mental model (User, Role, dimension axis, AR Metric, Apply rule), the canonical decision order, mandatory formula patterns (IFDEFINED guard, BLANK over FALSE), multi-app AR, debugging \"why can this user see / not see this data?\", and security governance. AR is part of model architecture, not an afterthought.","headings":["Securing Pigment Applications","When to Use This Skill","Mental Model","Decisions in Order","Non-Negotiable Rules","Glossary","Critical Rules (quick check)","Deeper Dives"],"name_hint":"securing · pigment · applications","description_zh":"设计、应用或排查 Pigment 访问权限，涵盖用户、角色、维度轴、权限指标及 Apply 规则，采用 IFDEFINED 防护和以 BLANK 代替 FALSE 等公式模式。适用于跨应用权限、可见性故障及安全治理，权限属于模型架构。"},{"path":"skills/solving-specific-use-cases/SKILL.md","name":"solving-specific-use-cases","description":"Always use this skill when building or extending models for specific planning domains — FP&A, Workforce Planning, Sales Performance Management, Supply Chain Planning, or Financial Consolidation. Covers proven modeling patterns and domain-specific best practices. This skill includes supporting files in this directory - explore as needed.","headings":["Pigment Use Cases — Introduction","When to Use This Skill","1. FP&A — Financial Planning & Analysis","2. Workforce Planning","3. Sales Performance Management (SPM)","4. Supply Chain Planning (SCP)","5. Financial Consolidation","Cross-References"],"name_hint":"solving · specific · use · cases","description_zh":"为 FP&A、人力规划、销售绩效管理、供应链规划及财务合并等领域构建或扩展 Pigment 模型，采用经过验证的建模模式及领域实践，并按需读取配套资料。"},{"path":"skills/writing-pigment-formulas/SKILL.md","name":"writing-pigment-formulas","description":"Always use this skill when writing, editing, or debugging Pigment formulas — including conditional logic, blank handling, date-range logic, aggregation, prior-period lookups, and dimensional transformations. Pigment uses a proprietary formula language — NEVER assume you know the syntax, and ALWAYS read the documentation before writing any formula. Covers data types, modifiers, functions, calculation patterns, and performance trade-offs (calibrated by formula complexity). This skill includes supporting files in this directory; explore as needed.","headings":["Writing Pigment Formulas","When to Use This Skill","Syntax Fundamental","Performance Patterns","Formula Writing Process","Formula Validation and Building Tools","Quick Validation","Structural Dimension Changes: Check Downstream Formulas","Prerequisites","Type Considerations","Quick Reference","Function Reference","Most Common Functions & Modifiers","By Category","Cross-References","Critical Notes","Formula Commenting Standard","Key Rules Summary"],"name_hint":"writing · pigment · formulas","description_zh":"编写、编辑和调试 Pigment 专有公式，处理条件、空值、日期范围、聚合、前期查找和维度转换。覆盖类型、修饰符、函数、计算模式及复杂度相关性能权衡；原说明要求先读文档，不凭记忆猜语法。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["Pigment AI Plugins","Prerequisites","Installation","Cursor","Claude Code","Configuration","What's Included","MCP Server","Skills","Example Prompts","Support"]}],"mcp_servers":["pigment"],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".cursor-plugin/marketplace.json",".cursor-plugin/plugin.json",".gitignore",".mcp.json","LICENSE","README.md","SECURITY.md","logo.svg","skills/analyzing-pigment-data/SKILL.md","skills/building-pigment-frames/SKILL.md","skills/designing-boards/SKILL.md","skills/designing-boards/board_design_rules.md","skills/designing-boards/board_pages.md","skills/designing-boards/relevant_views.md","skills/designing-boards/scoring_relevant_views.md","skills/designing-boards/view_widgets.md","skills/designing